<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Delhi to Bangalore | Express Enclosed Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading process protect my car during Delhi to Bangalore transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp gently lowers your vehicle onto the enclosed carrier, eliminating manual lifting and reducing impact forces. Sensors monitor ramp speed, and trained operators align the car precisely with wheel chocks. This method, combined with edge padding, ensures no scratches or dents, fulfilling our zero‑scratch guarantee for packers and movers delhi to bangalore services.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for RTO registration when moving a vehicle from Delhi to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need the original registration certificate, a valid insurance policy, a signed transport agreement, the e‑Way bill, and a GST invoice. Shree Ashirwad also prepares a statutory clearance form for both Delhi and Karnataka RTOs, streamlining the process and preventing delays during your car shift.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long will my car take to reach Bangalore via the NH‑19 route, and can I track it live?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Typical transit time is 3‑4 business days, depending on traffic and weather. Our fleet is equipped with GPS satellite tracking, allowing you to monitor the vehicle’s exact location in real time through a secure portal. You’ll receive automated updates at key milestones, ensuring full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees in the car transport cost from Delhi to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No. Our pricing model is fully transparent: the quoted amount includes base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance, and any mandatory statutory fees. Optional services such as premium packaging or expedited delivery are clearly itemised. We never add surprise charges, aligning with the trust built by packers and movers delhi to bangalore customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage does Shree Ashirwad provide for vehicle transit, and is it IRDAI‑approved?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance that complies with IRDAI regulations. The policy protects against loss, theft, and accidental damage during the entire Delhi‑Bangalore route. A detailed insurance certificate is shared with you before loading, giving full confidence in our zero‑scratch promise.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I schedule a same‑day pick‑up for my car in Delhi and delivery in Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Same‑day pick‑up is available for bookings made before 10 AM, subject to carrier availability. While the transit itself still follows the standard 3‑4 day schedule, we prioritize loading and dispatch to ensure your vehicle departs Delhi at the earliest slot, reducing overall delivery time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches and dents during long‑distance vehicle transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch protocol combines four layers of protection: a joint pre‑load inspection, hydraulic ramp loading, 4‑wheel lock securing, and custom edge‑padding for vulnerable panels. Each step is documented with photos, and our drivers are trained in gentle handling techniques, guaranteeing a pristine arrival for every packers and movers delhi to bangalore shipment.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
